Package: SSHd
Priority: Optional
Section: Network
Maintainer: Christiane Ruetten <cr@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.6.0
Version: 0.2.1-1
Environment: arm
Licence: Free
Description: SSH and SFTP server for remote access
 Log in to this machine from another computer with ssh: run *commands,
 use an interactive command line, and copy files with sftp or scp.  It
 runs on the desktop with an icon on the icon bar.  Logins use public
 keys only, added in its Keys window (paste, drop a .pub file, or import
 from another machine).  Settings and keys are kept in Choices:SSHd.
 MIT licensed; includes libssh (LGPL 2.1) and mbedTLS (Apache 2.0), see
 RiscPkg.Copyright.
Homepage: https://github.com/cr/riscosshd
Depends: CryptRandom
Components: Apps.Network.!SSHd (Movable LookAt Run)
